{
  "id": "poem-c8ba1e3933948fe35d787ddb",
  "title": "五供养",
  "author": "施惠《幽闺记》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "(旦)别来久矣，自离朝尊体无恙。",
    "骨肉重再睹，喜非常。",
    "(外)孩儿，屈指数月，折倒尽昔时模样。",
    "思故里，念家乡，多少鬓边霜。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-3003",
